{
  "id": "javascript-arrays",
  "title": "JavaScript Arrays",
  "sourcePages": [
    5,
    6
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "פעולות נפוצות על Arrays ב-JavaScript בזמן Live Coding."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "יצירה ועדכון"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const numbers =\n    new Array(5).fill(0);\n\nconst numbersWithData =\n    [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];\n\nnumbers[0] = 10;"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "הדפסה"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const arrayAsString =\n    numbersWithData.join(\", \");\n\nconsole.log(\n    arrayAsString\n);\n\nconsole.log(\n    JSON.stringify(\n        numbersWithData\n    )\n);"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "חיבור Arrays"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const combined = [\n    ...firstArray,\n    ...secondArray\n];"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "העברת Array לפונקציה"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "methodName([\n    1,\n    2,\n    4,\n    4\n]);"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Reverse"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "numbersWithData.reverse();"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "reverse משנה את ה-array המקורי. כאשר הסביבה תומכת ב-toReversed, אפשר לקבל עותק הפוך בלי mutation."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const reversedCopy =\n    numbersWithData\n        .toReversed();"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "בדיקת Contains"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const containsThree =\n    numbersWithData\n        .includes(3);"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "הסרה לפי Value"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const withoutThree =\n    numbersWithData.filter(\n        number =>\n            number !== 3\n    );"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "הוספה להתחלה"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const withThreeFirst = [\n    3,\n    ...numbersWithData\n];"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Swap"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "function swapInArray(\n    array,\n    firstIndex,\n    secondIndex\n) {\n    [\n        array[firstIndex],\n        array[secondIndex]\n    ] = [\n        array[secondIndex],\n        array[firstIndex]\n    ];\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Array ל-Set וחזרה"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "code": "const uniqueSet =\n    new Set(\n        numbersWithData\n    );\n\nconst uniqueArray = [\n    ...uniqueSet\n];"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "variant": "info",
      "title": "Mutation",
      "text": "reverse משנה את ה-array המקורי. filter, spread ו-toReversed יוצרים array חדש."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "שאלות קצרות"
    },
    {
      "type": "qa",
      "question": "איך מסירים כפילויות מ-Array?",
      "answer": "יוצרים Set וממירים אותו חזרה ל-Array באמצעות spread."
    },
    {
      "type": "qa",
      "question": "האם filter משנה את ה-Array המקורי?",
      "answer": "לא. הוא מחזיר Array חדש."
    },
    {
      "type": "qa",
      "question": "איך מבצעים Swap קצר ב-JavaScript?",
      "answer": "באמצעות destructuring assignment."
    }
  ]
}